      <color=#ffa3fe>3</style> <style=coinColor>{0:CommaNumber}</style></size></b>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_3
    value: <style=title><style=coinColor><size=42>MAGIC WILD FEATURE</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_3
    value: "<size=26><color=#ffa3fe>Magic Wild lands on reels 2 and 4 only and substitutes\nfor
      all symbols except <style=coinColor>Scatter</style>.\nWhen Magic Wild appears
      on reels, one of the followings\nis randomly triggered:\n\n<style=coinColor>-Stays
      the same\n-Expand up or down\n-Expand in both directions \n-Magic Wild clones
      the left adjacent\n symbol(s) to the right.</style>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_LINES
    value: <style=title><style=coinColor><size=42>LINES
  - key: PAYTABLE_WAY_INFO
    value: <size=24><style=coinColor>50 LINES</size>
  - key: PAYTABLE_BET_INFO
    value: '<size=24><style=coinColor>Bet Per Line: 1</size>'
  - key: BONUS_WIN_VALUE
    value: '{0:CommaNumber}'
  - key: COIN_PRIZE
    value: '{0:SimpleNumber}'
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_NAME_0
    value: <style=title><style=coinColor><size=32>WILD</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_0
    value: '<size=26><color=#ffa3fe>Appears on reels 2, 3, 4, and 5.

      Substitutes for all symbols except

      <style=coinColor>Scatter</style> and <style=coinColor>Magic Wild</style>.'
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_NAME_1
    value: <style=title><style=coinColor><size=32>SCATTER</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_1
    value: "<size=23><color=#ffa3fe>Appears on reel 1 only.\n3 or more <style=coinColor>Scatters</style>
      from Magic Wild Feature\ntriggers Magic Surprise Feature where\nplayer can win
      either Magic Show Bonus \nor Hocus-Pocus Free Games."
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_NAME_2
    value: '<style=title><style=coinColor><size=32>Hocus-Pocus

      Free Games</style>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_2
    value: <size=26><color=#ffa3fe>There are no low symbols on reels.
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_NAME_3
    value: <style=title><style=coinColor><size=32>Magic Show Bonus</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_3
    value: '<size=26><color=#ffa3fe>Pick Bonus awards multipliers

      on consecutive wins.'
